Dictionary data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The offline dictionary pack is not part of this program: it is downloaded
separately and carries its own licenses (JMdict/JMnedict/KANJIDIC2 under
CC BY-SA 4.0 from the EDRDG, plus Shirabe's Spanish adaptations). See the pack's
manifest and https://shirabe.org/credits for full attribution: that page is
kept current as the data changes, which is why the extension links to it rather
than shipping a copy that drifts.

